      "kind": "complete selected cpp function text",
      "text": "NiGpibDriver::NiGpibDriver() : module_(0), lastSta_(ERR)\n{\n    for (int i = 0; i < 12; ++i)\n        fn_[i] = 0;\n    HMODULE h = ::LoadLibraryA(\"gpib-32.dll\");\n    if (!h)\n        return;\n    bool ok = true;\n    for (int i = 0; i < 12; ++i)\n    {\n        fn_[i] = reinterpret_cast<void*>(::GetProcAddress(h, kNames[i]));\n        if (!fn_[i])\n            ok = false;\n    }\n    if (!ok)\n    {\n        ::FreeLibrary(h);\n        for (int i = 0; i < 12; ++i)\n            fn_[i] = 0;\n        return;\n    }\n    module_ = h;\n}",
      "sha256_utf8": "e5287ac42aa33aff6eb40c8b8ed724cebdc60b21a4a0c10e3de8db95f0d3f0fd"
